      "text": "Such savings may be reassigned in whole or in part to other\nprograms, activities, etc., as you see fit, based on your evaluation of\nwhere these savings can best be achieved. The savings should be realized\nin areas that will not adversely affect essential city services so as to\ninsure a minimum of inconvenience to the public.",
